SUMMARY:🐶 Barktoberfest at Boxyard RTP 🎃🍺
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nDogs in Halloween costumes. Beer. Fo
 od. Fall weather.\n\nI’m not sure we need a harder sell than that.\n\nWe
 ’re heading to Barktoberfest at Boxyard RTP for an afternoon of ridiculo
 us dog costumes\, drinks\, food\, and hanging out.\n\n🐕 What’s happen
 ing:\n\n* Dog costume contests 🎃\n* Agility activities\n* Local vendors
 \n* Food & drinks throughout Boxyard\n* Lots of dogs being forced to parti
 cipate in Halloween against their better judgment\n\nYou absolutely do NOT
  need a dog to come. Come for the dogs\, people watching\, food\, drinks\,
  and company.\n\nWe’ll meet at Boxyard RTP around 1 PM\, grab drinks/foo
 d\, check out the festivities\, and hang out together as we take in these 
 majestic creatures.\n\n🐶 Have a dog? Bring them! Costumes highly encour
 aged.\n\n🍺 No dog? Even easier. Grab a beer and help us judge everyone 
 else’s.\n\nCost: Free to attend. Food and drinks are on your own.\n\nCom
 e solo or bring a friend. As usual\, new people are very welcome—we’ll
  make it easy to find the group.\n\nSee you and your tiny costumed monster
 s there. 🐕🎃🍻
