SUMMARY:🎆 ZincHouse 4th Anniversary Party + Fireworks 🍷🍺
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nWine\, beer\, music\, food\, a beaut
 iful outdoor setting — and fireworks. Seems like a pretty solid excuse t
 o get a group together.\n\nWe’re heading to ZincHouse Winery & Brewery t
 o celebrate their 4th anniversary and hang out for the evening before capp
 ing the night with their anniversary fireworks show. 🎆\n\nZincHouse has
  a huge property with plenty of outdoor space to explore\, grab a drink\, 
 listen to music\, eat\, and hang out. We’ll meet up\, find a good home b
 ase for the group\, and enjoy the festivities together.\n\n🍷 Wine\n🍺
  Beer\n🍹 Drinks\n🍔 Food\n🎶 Music\n🎆 Fireworks show\n\nCome sol
 o or bring friends. New people are absolutely welcome — these events are
  meant to be an easy way to meet people without awkward organized icebreak
 ers or anything like that.\n\nWe’ll post our location once we’ve claim
 ed a spot so everyone can find us.\n\nGood drinks. Good people. Big firewo
 rks. See you there. 🎆
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31679
 1789/
