SUMMARY:Trick & Meet: A Very Scary Singles Mixer (20s-30s)
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nAre you a Morticia looking for your 
 Gomez? Maybe you're Chucky looking for his Tiffany! Jack Skellingtons and 
 Sallys come one and all to find your doomed duo.\n\nSpooky season is here\
 , and we wanna run it back for everyone else! 👻\n\nJoin Triangle Third 
 Place and Discover Durham Together at Drink a Bull in Durham for a mixer f
 illed with tea\, cocktails\, mocktails\, new connections\, and just enough
  Halloween chaos.\n\n**🎃 Come in costume\, add a little spooky flair\, 
 or just show up as yourself... there is no requirement.**\n\n🟢**Spooky 
 Bingo**\n\nWhat's the best way to learn something you didn’t know before
 ? Bingo\, obviously. Walk around and check off some boxes\, chat with new 
 friends\, or lovers and win a super secret dark prize!\n\n☕ **Spill the 
 Tea**\n\nWho doesn't like some Tea? We’ll also have an anonymous Spill t
 he Tea jar circulating throughout the evening.\n\nDrop in a confession\, u
 npopular opinion\, ridiculous dating story\, queer awakening\, Halloween h
 ot take\, or harmless secret. Throughout the night\, we’ll pull a few ou
 t and expose them.\n\nNo names. No judgment. Potentially a little chaos.\n
 \n🐂 **Drink a Bull**\n\nDrink a Bull serves both specialty teas and alc
 oholic beverages\, so whether your potion of choice is boozy\, caffeinated
 \, or completely alcohol-free\, there’s something for you.\n\n🚗 Plent
 y of parking around the building\, but if it fills up you can park at Doll
 ar General and walk over\n💕 A little singles mixer etiquette (with love
 !) 😂\nWe’re excited to bring everyone together for a fun\, relaxed ni
 ght of meeting new people\, making connections\, and maybe finding a littl
 e chemistry! ✨\nTo help keep things comfortable and fun for everyone\, j
 ust a few friendly reminders:\n\n* Flirting is welcome! Just make sure the
  interest is mutual. 😉\n* Respect boundaries. If someone’s not intere
 sted\, no hard feelings! There are plenty of new people to meet.\n* Rememb
 er\, being friendly doesn’t automatically mean someone is flirting.\n* B
 e kind and respectful to everyone\, whether there’s romantic interest or
  not.\n* Don’t be shy about starting a conversation! That’s why we’r
 e all here. 💕\n\nMost importantly\, we’re a community first and a sin
 gles mixer second. We want everyone to leave feeling comfortable\, respect
 ed\, and happy they came!\nIf anything makes you uncomfortable\, please fi
 nd a host. We’re here to help. 💛\nBe yourself. Be respectful. Keep th
 e creepy vibes at home. 😂💕\nCome for the company. Stay for the chemi
 stry. 😉
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31703
 4189/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261018T140253Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261018T140253Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
