DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nPlease join us for a feast and frien
 dship. We are so greatful to be a part of this group and would love for yo
 u to join us this Thanksgiving.\nWe will send out a sign up sheet closer t
 o the date with food and items to bring.
